---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import InteractiveEmbed from '../../../components/InteractiveEmbed.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Memory Steering — Jeff Arnold Labs"
  description="Explore the interactive 3D embedding viewers from Zero-Shot Latent Space Steering."
>
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Memory Steering</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-slate-700">
    Interactive 3D embedding viewers from the
    <a href="/blogs/latent-space-steering-part-1" class="underline">Zero-Shot Latent Space Steering</a>
    write-up. Click and drag to orbit, select points to read their text, and delete points to
    declutter the space.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold">Original embedding space</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 text-slate-700">
    Text blurbs from a conversation about cars, travel, and music, embedded and plotted in 3D.
    Distance between bubbles reflects how different the texts are.
  </p>
  <InteractiveEmbed
    src="/blog/latent-space-steering-part-1/blog_viz_1.html"
    title="Dude conversation: 3D embedding viewer"
    caption="Dude conversation: 3D embedding viewer"
    height="640px"
  />

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold">Steered toward “self-actualization”</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 text-slate-700">
    The same dataset after amplifying a theme — the embeddings distort and re-cluster along the
    theme’s conceptual axis, with LLM-generated ideas per cluster.
  </p>
  <InteractiveEmbed
    src="/blog/latent-space-steering-part-1/blog_viz_2.html"
    title="Dude conversation, self-actualization steering: 3D embedding viewer"
    caption="Self-actualization steered text embeddings and cluster-based LLM-generated ideas"
    height="640px"
  />
</Layout>
